{"v":4,"catch":"解開謎題，到達天堂！","desc":"《VS. MYSTERY TOWER》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1986年推出的動作益智遊戲。\n神秘塔是一座直達天堂的古老建築，充滿秘密。您扮演一位考古學家，在冒險中尋求它的巔峰。\n當你向目標前進時，堆放一些積木以供站立。您能解決途中的所有謎題並到達頂峰嗎？\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-03-06","genres":["益智","動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a9e8c6a678d50ffe36505d513ed0b878cae811feee4c646fb27a79bd782d7b36.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0a4fd0a0a105ec0b3dac47b4a7c4e98ca6bdaf3aa48e4d14368b57bcbd718d44.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2dfec23b2fe8dd1d1fdcdeb53ac5dd479b1620643c5d7a86b110bf07fe1fe548.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8e63a4bbb46f3c301ebe47414df81127273f9a6553a8a99d2e9a8eaf8b411c7f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b2a807da93558127bd555f6e647e45cacb19ecdae6122bed858987d5ea6da107.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7a8f172b112276cde9b0a5dd9be5f7f28ddc36387e6a647a85be2071106bb12d.jpg"],"titleId":"010072a01ea6c000","dlc":[]}